Package: mobgap
Title: R Interface to the 'mobgap' Python Module
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "John",
           family = "Muschelli",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "muschellij2@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6469-1750"))
Description: Interfaces the 'mobgap' Python module
    <https://github.com/mobilise-d/mobgap> using 'reticulate' to load
    Mobilise-D datasets (TVS free-living, TVS laboratory, and example data)
    and extract reference gait parameters such as walking bouts, initial
    contacts (steps), strides and turns as R data frames.
